            "uri": "http://invincible-agent/fin#ControlAccount",
            "label": "Control Account",
            "description": "The management point where scope, schedule and budget meet a single accountable manager, and the level at which performance is formally measured and reported. Questions naming an account identifier and asking how it is performing, who owns the number, or where a reported variance was incurred target this class. It is the lowest level at which a manager is answerable for a number.",
